<title>USA: TSX Corp current Q2 net shr loss nil.</title>
<headline>TSX Corp current Q2 net shr loss nil.</headline>
<dateline>EL PASO, Texas 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>TSX CORP</p>
<p>	     (IN THOUSANDS EXCEPT PER SHARE DATA)</p>
<p>					(Unaudited)	 (Unaudited)</p>
<p>				 THREE MONTHS ENDED  SIX MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>				 Oct. 26,  Oct. 28, Oct. 26, Oct. 28,</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> NET SALES		    $ 20,207 $ 23,998 $ 41,380 $ 44,325</p>
<p>   COST OF SALES		13,510   13,551   25,169   24,812</p>
<p> GROSS PROFIT		    6,697   10,447   16,211   19,513</p>
<p>ENGINEERING, SALES,</p>
<p>GENERAL and</p>
<p>  ADMIN. EXPENSES		5,134    4,513   10,325    8,876</p>
<p>UNUSUAL ITEMS OF</p>
<p>  EXPENSE (a)		    2,109	 --    2,109	 --</p>
<p>INCOME (LOSS)</p>
<p>  from OPERATIONS		(546)    5,934    3,777   10,637</p>
