<p>  NET OTHER INCOME		 354	 84	642	205</p>
<p> INCOME (LOSS) BEFORE TAX    (192)    6,018    4,419   10,842</p>
<p> NET INCOME (LOSS)		(35)    3,734    3,461    6,936</p>
<p>NET INCOME (LOSS)</p>
<p>  per SHARE			   --     0.23     0.22     0.43</p>
<p>NUMBER of SHARES</p>
<p>  FULLY DILUTED		 15,423   16,062   16,065   16,043</p>
<p>NOTE: (a)  Reflected in Unusual Items of Expense are charges of $2,109 related to the downsizing of the company's advertising insertion usiness segment, which excludes $1,453 of related inventory write-down included in Cost of Sales.</p>
<p>Included in the Q2 net loss is a one-time charge of $3.6 million or $0.18 per share to effect the downsizing of Texscan MSI, the company's advertising insertion business segment.</p>
<p>The company's core business, excluding charge, would have reported revenues of $19.2 million, net income of $3.3 million and earnings per share of $0.21.</p>
